<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document" style="font-size:207%;">Towards Affordable, Adaptive and Automatic GNN Training on CPU-GPU Heterogeneous Platforms
<br class="ltx_break">
<span class="ltx_pubnotes"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_thanks"><span class="ltx_note_name">Thanks: </span><span id="id11" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:207%;">
